WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.800
Okay!

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.100
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.767
A.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:05.433
Radish,

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:06.100
B.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:06.767
Cabinet,

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:07.433
C.

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:08.100
Chair,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.433
or D.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:10.100
Dresser?

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.400
Five seconds!

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.867
TIME'S UP!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.700
The answer is...

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.167
A,

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:20.633
radish!

00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:21.100
Chair,

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:21.567
cabinet,

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.933
and dresser are all furniture.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:25.800
Radish is a vegetable,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.133
so it does not belong.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.800
Here's one,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.500
a picture puzzle!

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.867
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:35.433
A.

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:36.000
Top-right,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.567
B.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.133
Bottom-left,

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:37.700
C.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.233
Top,

00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:39.367
or D.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:39.933
Bottom?

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:41.067
Five seconds!

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:47.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:47.967 --> 00:00:49.300
The answer is...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:49.733
A,

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:50.200
top-right!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.833
The dot moves three spots counter-clockwise

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:55.067
around the grid each step,

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:57.733
so the next spot is top-right.

00:00:58.233 --> 00:00:59.500
Here's one,

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.400
a number series!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.033
Three,

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:02.633
six,

00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:03.267
nine,

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:03.900
fifteen,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:04.533
twenty-four,

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:05.800
and then...

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.700
what comes next?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.333
A.

00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:08.967
Forty-four,

00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:09.600
B.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.233
Thirty-seven,

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:10.833
C.

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:11.467
Thirty-nine,

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:12.733
or D.

00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:13.367
Forty?

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:14.633
Five seconds!

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.100
TIME'S UP!

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:22.567
What's your answer?

